# Regression Guard

For every bug fix, validate impacted adjacent flows.

For auth/onboarding changes, always check:
- Login flow
- Create account flow
- Startup initialization path
- Error display UX (inline/snackbar/message quality)

If a fix reveals another issue:
- Continue investigation until root cause is identified.
- Separate newly discovered underlying issue from original issue.
